{
  "title": "OccluderShape",
  "description": "Where an OccluderComponent takes its outline from: - `'bounds'`: the node's local bounds, re-read every frame. - `'alpha'`: the node's own texture alpha, as AlphaOccluder traces it. The node must be a drawable with a texture, such as a `Sprite`. - `{ points, closed? }`: an outline of your own in the node's local space, as PolygonOccluder reads it. - `{ body }`: the colliders of a physics body, sensors excluded. - any OccluderSource, used as it is.",
